  "sourceFindings": [
    "Complete selected entries 310–326 finish the pinned Menstruation inventory: 37 numbered records, 29 digital chapter headings, seven chapter introductions and one book introduction. Four newly admitted chapter introductions remain unchanged Arabic outside numbered sessions and narration scripts, with English pending.",
    "Explicit two-print corrections restore the hair-undoing verb in 311 and the feminine reporting-verb ending in 324. Unchanged original paragraphs, exact offsets and both witness readings remain accessible offline. Other differences between editions are documented rather than silently normalised.",
    "The source changes of speaker in 310, 316 and 318 remain. Hisham’s closing note at 311, the alternative at 315, the Eid wording alternative at 318 and Tawus’s closing transmission at 323 remain in their original positions.",
    "Both inspected prints have an untitled chapter before 326. It is separately declared as Chapter, making 30 browsing sections without changing the digital 29-chapter inventory or inserting a heading into the narration. The heading-only attribution now accurately describes the supplied material.",
    "Working renderings, lexical ambiguities and differing English comparison coverage remain documented. The EPUB omits one discharge word at 320; Bewley omits the bathing instruction at 321. Neither omission shortens the Arabic-derived working translation.",
    "All seventeen English comparison bodies were individually matched: Bewley 310–326 and pinned EPUB 1.6.313–1.6.329. This records local matches, not a universal cross-edition numbering rule or independent approval.",
    "All prior 309 entry objects and five other book packs remain unchanged. Actual recordings remain 1–6; no new recording was made."
  ],
